          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Add a cordless handheld such as the <strong class="text-white">Water Tech Pool Blaster Max Li</strong> for steps and spas, set the flow properly, keep hoses straight, and replace wear parts before they fail. If you would rather not load your pump at all, a robot is the next step up.
          </p>
